    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d287">

                <pb facs="0462" n="358" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg358"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.13/8.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 7, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President Gomez to-day signed the amnesty bill in spite of having full knowledge
                    of the views of Department’s March 7, and of the threatened American
                    interests.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
